{"id":"46caa19bb1e0ac82","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-factorial-function.md","title":"Factorial Function","display":"df-factorial-function — Factorial Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-factorial-function","aliases":["90-df-factorial-function","90-df-fact"],"display":"df-factorial-function — Factorial Function","depends_on":["[[90-df-multiplication-function]]","[[90-df-successor-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-factorial-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-factorial-function</span><span>90-df-fact</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-factorial-function — Factorial Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"88d284a5e496e4ef\" href=\"?note=88d284a5e496e4ef\" title=\"90-df-multiplication-function\">90-df-multiplication-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b769360437f9e54a\" href=\"?note=b769360437f9e54a\" title=\"90-df-successor-function\">90-df-successor-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-factorial-function-—-Factorial-Function-$\\mathrm{fact}$\">df-factorial-function — Factorial Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact}\">\\(\\mathrm{fact}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S : \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(S : \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (后继函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b769360437f9e54a\" href=\"?note=b769360437f9e54a\" title=\"90-df-successor-function\">90-df-successor-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{mul} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathrm{mul} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (乘法函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"88d284a5e496e4ef\" href=\"?note=88d284a5e496e4ef\" title=\"90-df-multiplication-function\">90-df-multiplication-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact} : \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathrm{fact} : \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (factorial function, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}factorial\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{fact}(0) \\coloneqq 1 \\;\\land\\; \\forall n \\in \\mathbb{N}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{fact}(n+1) \\coloneqq \\mathrm{mul}(S(n),\\mathrm{fact}(n))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}factorial\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{fact}(0) \\coloneqq 1 \\;\\land\\; \\forall n \\in \\mathbb{N}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{fact}(n+1) \\coloneqq \\mathrm{mul}(S(n),\\mathrm{fact}(n))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact}(n) = n!\">\\(\\mathrm{fact}(n) = n!\\)</span>（阶乘函数）</li>\n<li>递归步同时使用前一值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact}(n)\">\\(\\mathrm{fact}(n)\\)</span> 与后继 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(n)=n+1\">\\(S(n)=n+1\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a> — 原始递归函数类</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ac2460aba5c368e5\" href=\"?note=ac2460aba5c368e5\" title=\"90-df-primrec-operator\">90-df-primrec-operator</a> — 原始递归算子</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"88d284a5e496e4ef\" hr